          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Norden from Old High German nordan, \"from the north\" — inherited. EtymDB 2.1 traces English north to Proto-Germanic nurþrą: the same word."
